### 1. 注册新用户
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456",
  "rePassword": "123456"
}

### 2. 登录（先执行注册，再用同样的账号密码登录）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. 获取当前用户信息（把下面的 YOUR_TOKEN 替换成登录返回的 token）
GET http://localhost:8080/user/userInfo
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

### 4. 修改用户信息（带参数校验：昵称1-10位，邮箱格式）
PUT http://localhost:8080/user/update
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "nickname": "管理员",
  "email": "admin@example.com"
}

### 5. 上传头像（在 IDEA 中运行时选择一张本地图片）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/upload
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./avatar.png
--WebAppBoundary--

### 6. 更新头像URL（把第5步返回的 /uploads/xxx.png 填到 avatar 里）
PUT http://localhost:8080/user/update
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "nickname": "管理员",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "avatar": "/uploads/xxx.png"
}

### 7. 修改密码
PUT http://localhost:8080/user/updatePwd
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{
  "old_pwd": "123456",
  "new_pwd": "654321"
}
